  "finding": "Offline configured-provider replay selected the exact canonical heading hash while retaining a lowercase alternative hash, so candidate hashing was added without retaining recognized text. Overlapping Notepad windows and mirrored tab-title rows were then excluded. Pushed 82cb017 moved the real editor body through a lossless native crop; its live probe returned the exact heading hash twice at 0.9143 confidence, but the downstream status invariant sampled y=317 instead of the bottom edge. Pushed d85dd65 bounded a shared native bottom-status-edge proof to top-screen maximized editors. A live exact heading action passed with zero corrections or retries, and a separate input-free invocation proved the new y=650 edge path before a 77.248-second reboot. That gate allowed recorded Code-09 v6 to run. The prior installed-observer absence capture remains valid only for the earlier probes; v6's independent observer launch failed separately and is retained in code-09-v6-observer-comparison.json."
